Hcode capability migration reference
------------------------------------

Repository: git@github.com:PooooLish/Hcode.git
Reviewed baseline: d77927f7f2079b103c8077d321f0b24077c75800
License: MIT License
Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 PooooLish

Phase 0 used Hcode only as a read-only source of architecture, algorithms,
and test scenarios.

Phase 3 adapted the usage-anchor and conservative-estimation design from
`hcode/conversation.py` and `hcode/context/manager.py` into
`src/tricoder/context/manager.py`. The TriCoder message grouping and
`src/tricoder/context/spill.py` security/lifecycle implementation were
independently rewritten for TriCoder; no Hcode source text was copied.

If a later phase copies or substantially adapts Hcode implementation code,
this notice must be updated with the affected TriCoder and Hcode file paths,
and the Hcode copyright and MIT permission notice must be retained.
